            "notes": "The first power we always take is  [Megaphone](item_d995adf3-1789-4a16-b85c-21b8c14e4f7d) . It has longer amp duration but more importantly it increases the radius by 150%, leading to an aura that's 2.5 times larger than normal. This is extremely important to have in time for round 2.\n\n\nFor items, we want to build ability power and survivability.  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) so that when we ult, we have 20% AP.  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) will also help with survivability, giving 100 armor after you ult!\n\n\nThe goal is to farm as much credits as possible, so stay on healing unless you need to rapidly fall back or advance to chase a kill. Do NOT amp out of spawn, as you'll get there quickly and may need amp when you arrive for the team.",
