            "created_at": "2025-08-11T19:03:11.654344+00:00",
            "notes": "[#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) is a must buy. This, with the increased size from  [Megaphone](item_d995adf3-1789-4a16-b85c-21b8c14e4f7d) will let you keep your aura on your entire team with insane uptime, letting you dive, play from cover, or simply let others dive without you.\n\nIf you have enough funds, you can also pick up  [All-Out Auditiva](item_7e33b7e7-4f7a-4f9f-bc25-39ce2a8f56b2) for a total of 15,000 credits, but if not then pick it up next round. Otherwise pick up  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) ,  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) , and  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) in that order.\n\nGenerally, we'll be picking up 1 major item per round, and stacking ability power unless you can buy the next.",
