            "notes": "Here is when we come to the first choice in power, depending on how the game is going. If you're able to get picks, dive with your team, or are confident in diving solo, you can pick up  [Let\u2019s Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b). It will give you extra damage and aggression, but this also means you will be healing overall less compared to the alternative:  [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c) . If you need to peel for your team by booping away divers or brawlers, or you somehow need more healing and a little burst, take this.\n\nFor items, we pick up  [All-Out Auditiva](item_7e33b7e7-4f7a-4f9f-bc25-39ce2a8f56b2) here, stacking ability power on top of it, the standard of  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) ,  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) , and  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295). Amp duration means it has the big range for longer, letting you support your own or others dives better. If you have enough, you can pick up the next item:  [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4)",
