            "notes": "Round off your items with  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) for an insane boost to your stats, but there is a choice in final powers. \n\nIf the enemy team has an Ashe or Queen or Moira or other form of widespread damage, take  [Radio Edit](item_cd4b345d-19ff-4a91-917e-b133fe5ba4c2) to mitigate some of it. Radio Edit beat also does do damage caused by  [Beat Drop](item_d3d5876b-bd40-4bd9-9954-c65e2295cc2d).\n\nIf you took  [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c) or  [Let\u2019s Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b) you can grab  [Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) to double up on it.\n\nYou can also simply pick up  [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c) or  [Let\u2019s Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b) to complement the one you don't have for both effects.\n\nPick whatever makes more sense, or you have a personal preference for!",
